💡 用 CLI 跑作者的完整情境存成 run.json，看六件事怎麼串起來；親手從 JSON 重算 7 個產物雜湊，確認和信封一致，再竄改一個產物看它對不上。重點整理另存 evidence-reading.md。

▶ 要執行的程式：
  │ import json, subprocess, sys
  │ from pathlib import Path
  │ from chapters.ch07.scenario import _stable_hash
  │ od = Path("../ch07/interactive"); od.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
  │ for name in ("run.json", "evidence-reading.md"):
  │     (od / name).unlink(missing_ok=True)
  │ out = subprocess.run([sys.executable, "-m", "harnesslab.cli", "run", "ch07", "--json"],
  │                      capture_output=True, text=True, encoding="utf-8")
  │ (od / "run.json").write_text(out.stdout, encoding="utf-8")
  │ data = json.loads(out.stdout)[0]
  │ art = data["artifacts"]
  │ 
  │ passed, score = data["passed"], data["score"]
  │ print(f"通過={passed} 分數={score}")
  │ ro = art["redacted_observation"]
